{"t":"Diving Equipment","s":"diving-equipment-3a449","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Depth_Galea_5bb93b.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><b>Diving Equipment</b> is equipment that will allow you to be <a href=\"#/wiki/Underwater\">underwater</a> without suffering 5 times 20 <a href=\"#/wiki/Drown%20Damage\">Drown Damage</a> kicking in after four seconds of standing still. The entering of <a href=\"#/wiki/Calassa\">Calassa</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Frozen%20Trench\">Frozen Trench</a>, both <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent%20Area\">Sea Serpent Areas</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sunken%20Quarter\">Sunken Quarter</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Channel\">Water Channels</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Grotto\">Quara Grotto</a> requires you to wear one of these pieces. Once there, however, the equipment can be taken off anytime without having to exit the water.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">Attributes\n</th>\n<th style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">Weight\n</th>\n<th>Dropped By\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\">Depth Galea</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\"><img alt=\"Depth Galea\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Depth_Galea_5bb93b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">46.00\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Jaul\">Jaul</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\"><img alt=\"Helmet of the Deep\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Helmet_of_the_Deep_fb3803.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">210.00\n</td>\n<td><ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","quests":["the-dream-courts-quest"]}